# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:12
translate chinese bakery_dc67bb58:

    # bla "Hiya. The night's a little less dark with you around."
    bla "嗨，有你在身边，夜晚不再那么黑暗。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:18
translate chinese blamenu_acd042f8:

    # bla "Sure thing! Want to hang out in my nexus room? Time is slower in there, so we can yap for ages!"
    bla "当然！要不要去我的枢纽房间闲逛？那里时间走得更慢，我们可以聊很久很久！"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:25
translate chinese blamenu_e431f4e1:

    # bla "Alright, let's head back to reality! Oops, there goes gravity!"
    bla "好吧，我们回到现实吧！哎呀，重力起作用了！"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:39
translate chinese blaomenu_2ecf6fea:

    # bla "Pretty convincing, eh? The only thing I can't change is my eye colour."
    bla "挺逼真的吧？唯一改不了的就是我瞳色。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:41
translate chinese blaomenu_88ba4796:

    # bla "But according to the game settings, we have the same eye colour! Nice!"
    bla "但根据游戏设置，我们居然是同样的瞳色！太棒了！"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:42
translate chinese blaomenu_94e42a64:

    # bla "If you want to see me in pink, you'll have to go through the cheats menu."
    bla "想看粉毛的我？你得进作弊菜单才行。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:44
translate chinese blaomenu_435308a4:

    # bla "If you want to see me in white, you'll have to go through the cheats menu."
    bla "想看白色的我？你得进作弊菜单才行。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:59
translate chinese blaomenu_342132b2:

    # "I feel exhausted!"
    "我感觉精疲力尽！"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:103
translate chinese bakery1_0e1f4198:

    # "The bakery stood perilously close to a ravine, a vast and jagged fissure that carved the city in two. Though it was impossible to overlook, I had often let it fade into the background of my mind."
    "那家烘焙坊靠近一条深沟——一道宽阔而参差的裂缝，将城市一分为二。尽管那道裂缝无法忽视，我却常常将它淡出脑海。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:104
translate chinese bakery1_a8c9edc7:

    # "But standing by its edge, the full depth of the chasm revealed itself, plunging deep into the earth. It was an everpresent reminder that this Arcadia was fractured, scarred."
    "但当我站在边缘才真正看清它，深不见底，直插地底。它时时刻刻提醒着我，这个Arcadia满目疮痍。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:105
translate chinese bakery1_b0be2728:

    # "The streets near the ravine were unsettlingly desolate, and that doesn't surprise me at all. Who would want to live so close to a 1,000+ meter drop?"
    "裂缝附近的街道荒凉得令人不安，这一点并不令我惊讶。毕竟谁会愿意住在千米深渊的边缘？"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:106
translate chinese bakery1_314559f5:

    # "Despite that, buildings here looked expensive. Extravagant housing to take advantage of the beautiful view. But the area still sagged under the weight of neglect, with many shops shuttered and abandoned. Ironically, if there were a rough area in the city, this was it."
    "尽管如此，这里的建筑依旧富丽堂皇。似乎故意建得豪华，以俯瞰绝美景色。可这片区域依然因被遗弃而萧条，许多商铺紧闭，门可罗雀。讽刺的是，如果要评城中最凶险之地，当属这里无疑。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:109
translate chinese bakery1_be04a86c:

    # "I approached [cre]’s bakery, expecting that warm, familiar scent of fresh bread and sugar to welcome me like an old friend. But there was nothing."
    "我走向[cre]的面包店，期待那股熟悉的面包与糖的香气像老朋友般迎接我。然而，迎接我的却是一片寂静。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:110
translate chinese bakery1_e2f27dde:

    # "It was usually always open late, maybe not this late, but it was always welcoming none-the-less, its warm light spilling out into the street. But it was closed, windows barricaded with weathered planks of wood."
    "这家店向来营业到很晚，也许不会到这么晚，却总能以温暖的灯光洒满街道，给人归属感。但此刻却紧闭大门，窗户被斑驳的木板钉死。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:111
translate chinese bakery1_b8b922a4:

    # "I stepped closer, squinting through the glass. Darkness shrouded the interior. It looked abandoned."
    "我凑近玻璃，眯眼向里看。一片黑暗笼罩，似乎已经荒废。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:112
translate chinese bakery1_02f0e95b:

    # "What’s the harm in a knock? Just to be sure."
    "敲一敲又有什么坏处呢？只是为了确定。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:113
translate chinese bakery1_9ac06bdb:

    # "My knuckles tapped against the glass, the sound ringing out. I waited, ears straining for any hint of life inside."
    "我的指关节敲在玻璃上，清脆回响。我屏住呼吸，侧耳倾听门内的动静。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:114
translate chinese bakery1_270b9b66:

    # "Nothing. I sighed, casting a glance down the deserted street. But just as I turned to leave, a faint rustling reached my ears, barely more than a whisper."
    "寂静。叹了口气，我扫视了下空无一人的街道。正要转身离开时，却隐约听到一阵宛若耳语的沙沙声，似乎有人。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:115
translate chinese bakery1_2e408d85:

    # "Slow, almost begrudging footsteps moved towards the door. It creaked open, just a sliver at first, then it was thrown wide open."
    "缓慢的、几乎像是不情愿的脚步声逼近门口。门发出吱呀声，先是微微开了一条缝，接着猛地被推开。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:116
translate chinese bakery1_c571500c:

    # "But.... Just who is that?"
    "但...这家伙是谁"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:119
translate chinese bakery1_e2c19a8b:

    # "My brain struggled to process what I was seeing. The mare in the doorway looked identical to [cre] – same height, same build, same thick curls falling over her shoulders – but she’s… purple?"
    "我的大脑一时无法处理眼前景象。这只应门的雌驹与[cre]完全一样，同样的身高，身材，同样浓密的齐肩卷发，但她……是紫色的？"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:121
translate chinese bakery1_49367708:

    # bla "What… what are you doing here?"
    bla "你……你在这干什么？"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:122
translate chinese bakery1_5170457f:

    # "Her voice wasn’t the warm, inviting tone I expected. It was colder, more guarded, like she was sizing me up."
    "她的声音并没有我预想中的那样热情好客，反而冷峻且戒备，仿佛在打量我。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:123
translate chinese bakery1_d820d58b:

    # mc "I’m, uh, here to see [cre]."
    mc "我，额……我是来见[cre]的。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:124
translate chinese bakery1_c31eeff5:

    # "It came out more as a question than a statement. The mare tilted her head slightly, the movement so familiar."
    "这句话听起来更像疑问而非肯定。雌驹轻轻歪了歪头，动作竟是那样熟悉。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:126
translate chinese bakery1_c1e5810d:

    # bla "There’s no [cre] here. Only me. [bla]."
    bla "这里没有[cre]。只有我，[bla]。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:127
translate chinese bakery1_0c946908:

    # "[bla]..? My heart sank. She looked the same — her figure, her hair, even the way she stood - but this name, this person… was different version of her."
    "[bla]……？我心头一沉。她看起来一模一样——身形、发型、站姿——但这个名字，这个她……却是另一个她。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:129
translate chinese bakery1_ab52b72f:

    # bla "Look, whatever you’re selling, cream pies or otherwise, this place is closed, and I’m not interested."
    bla "听着，不管你想卖什么，奶油派还是别的，这里已经关门了，我也没兴趣。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:130
translate chinese bakery1_1334c46a:

    # "She scoffed, sharp and dismissive. But... her gaze never left mine. She began to push the door closed, slowly, as if daring me to stop her."
    "她的话语冷嘲热讽，尖刻而不屑，但是她的目光从未离开我，她开始把门慢慢的关上，似乎在挑衅我来阻止她。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:131
translate chinese bakery1_42a857d0:

    # mc "Wait! I need your help!"
    mc "等等，我需要你的帮助！"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:132
translate chinese bakery1_fc1c8849:

    # "The door paused halfway."
    "门停在了半关的状态。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:133
translate chinese bakery1_e967d08b:

    # mc "There’s a, uh… virtues initiative. I’m trying to gather a selection of people from this city to work with the Queen, and you’re…"
    mc "有个……谐律计划。我想从城里挑选一些人来和女王合作，而你……"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:135
translate chinese bakery1_4f777cc1:

    # bla "What would you know about that?"
    bla "你都知道些什么？"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:136
translate chinese bakery1_169f00c2:

    # "She cut me off, with a voice sharp as a blade. The door flew straight back open."
    "她用极其尖锐的声音打断了我，刚刚合上一半的门又打开了"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:138
translate chinese bakery1_d2aa83f8:

    # bla "What the hell are you even doing in this universe?!"
    bla "你在这个世界到底在干什么？"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:139
translate chinese bakery1_e091b8a3:

    # bla "It’s been what… four years. And you just randomly appear on my doorstep like this? Who do you think you are?"
    bla "整整过去了多少年？四年了。然后你就像这样突然出现在我家门口？你以为你是谁？"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:140
translate chinese bakery1_dd8f4296:

    # mc "I’m uh… I don’t know. Who do you think I am?"
    mc "我，呃……我不知道，你觉得我是谁？"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:141
translate chinese bakery1_df57cadc:

    # mc "You’re asking some pretty bizarre questions for a stranger living in an abandoned building."
    mc "对于作为一个住在废弃建筑物里的陌生人，你问了一些很奇怪的问题。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:143
translate chinese bakery1_c0647bca:

    # bla "Guh… I wasn’t expecting this at all. Wish he still had his memory…"
    bla "唉……我完全没料到会这样。真希望他仍记得……"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:145
translate chinese bakery1_b6d633a2:

    # bla "Wait, you {i}are{/i} him, aren’t you? [mc]?"
    bla "等等，你{i} 是{/i} 他 ，对吗？[mc]？"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:146
translate chinese bakery1_2e4cb245:

    # "The sound of my name coming from her lips was a shock."
    "从她的口中听到我的名字让我十分震惊。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:147
translate chinese bakery1_1761277a:

    # mc "How do you…? You knew I was from another universe too..."
    mc "你怎么……？你也知道我是从另一个世界来的……"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:149
translate chinese bakery1_cef4b9b8:

    # bla "Oh, there’s a lot I know, more than you could even begin to guess."
    bla "哦，我知道的很多，超乎你的想象。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:151
translate chinese bakery1_96256fc8:

    # bla "But if you’re here, then things might be far worse than you know."
    bla "但是如果你在这里，那事情的发展可能远比你想象的糟糕许多。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:152
translate chinese bakery1_700109b2:

    # bla "Listen. Whatever you think you know, whatever brought you here. It’s not enough. This place – it’s not what you remember, and it’s not what you’ve been told. It’s darker, stranger… hungrier."
    bla "听着，不管你自以为知道什么，不管是什么把你带到这里，都不够。这儿既不是你记忆中的模样，也不是别人告诉你的那样。它更黑暗、更怪异……更贪婪。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:154
translate chinese bakery1_9336dd60:

    # bla "If you’re him… Then you need to remember. You knew once, but you forgot."
    bla "如果你是他，那你得回想起来。你曾经知道，但你忘记了。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:155
translate chinese bakery1_fb307c6b:

    # bla "You came from a lovely universe, one designed to be wholesome, where everything was meant to go right."
    bla "你来自一个美好的世界，那是个追求和谐的世界，一切都理应顺利。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:156
translate chinese bakery1_af3cbdbe:

    # bla "Where the sun always shines, and the bad guys always lose. But this universe?"
    bla "那里的太阳总是晴朗，反派总是失败。但这里？"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:158
translate chinese bakery1_e7c0a949:

    # bla "This is a dark timeline. One where nothing went right, and nothing will ever go right."
    bla "这是个暗黑的时间线，在这里，一切都已走偏，并且永远不会回到正轨。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:160
translate chinese bakery1_4dc37c03:

    # "Her eyes lock back onto mine."
    "她的目光再次死死盯住我。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:162
translate chinese bakery1_175c49d4:

    # bla "So just… Give up. It’s not worth it. Not here."
    bla "所以……放弃吧，不值得。至少在这不值得。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:163
translate chinese bakery1_1b7f888f:

    # "Give up? That’s what she thinks I should do? I clenched my fist and shook my head."
    "放弃？她以为我该这么做？！我攥紧拳头，摇了摇头。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:164
translate chinese bakery1_87ed25b5:

    # mc "That’s exactly why I’m here in the first place! That’s what the virtues initiative is all about - stopping the nightmares!"
    mc "这正是我来这里的原因！这就是谐律计划的全部意义——阻止梦魇！"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:165
translate chinese bakery1_fad7831a:

    # mc "But I can’t do it alone. I need your help to do it."
    mc "但仅靠我一个人做不到，我需要你的帮助。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:167
translate chinese bakery1_596f01b5:

    # bla "Me?"
    bla "我？"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:169
translate chinese bakery1_15c280e0:

    # "She laughed, but it was a hollow sound, devoid of any real humor."
    "她笑了，但那是一种空洞的笑声，不带任何幽默的成分。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:171
translate chinese bakery1_8481dcf5:

    # bla "No, you want [cre]. But she doesn’t exist in this universe, and I’m certainly {i}not{/i} her."
    bla "不，你想找的是[cre]。但是她不在这个世界，我压根就{i} 不是 {/i}她。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:172
translate chinese bakery1_a862e106:

    # "Her words were confirmation of a fear that had been gnawing at me since I first laid eyes on her. [cre] didn’t exist here. That truth spoken aloud hit harder than I expected."
    "她的话印证了一个自从我第一次看到她以来一直萦绕在我心中的恐惧——[cre] 在这个世界上并不存在。真相被大声说出来时，给我的打击比我预想的还要大。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:173
translate chinese bakery1_108f4885:

    # "But as I stood there, something kept me grounded – a strange sense of familiarity between the two of us, a connection that I couldn’t shake."
    "但我们之间冥冥之中的一种熟悉感，一种无法摆脱的连结，让我保持镇定地站在原处。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:174
translate chinese bakery1_22faf8b1:

    # "And she wasn’t slamming the door on me; she was doing the opposite. She opened it wider, stepping into the doorway."
    "她并没有把我拒之门外；反而把门更大地敞开，走到门口。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:176
translate chinese bakery1_abada864:

    # bla "She misses you, you know."
    bla "你知道吗？她很想你"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:177
translate chinese bakery1_c272cb1d:

    # mc "[cre]? How could you know that? How could you know anything about [cre], or me, or other universes?"
    mc "[cre]？你怎么知道？你怎么会知道关于[cre]，我以及另一个宇宙的事呢？"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:179
translate chinese bakery1_52be08d7:

    # bla "Oh, I know."
    bla "哦，我就是知道。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:180
translate chinese bakery1_ccc863d6:

    # mc "Tch, fine. Let’s just ignore your freaky sixth sense for a moment and assume you do know everything. How can she miss me? There’s another me out there in her universe, isn’t there?"
    mc "哼，好吧。暂且不论你那诡异的第六感，就假设你真知道一切。那她怎么会想念我？毕竟还有另一个我在她那个世界陪着她，不是吗？"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:182
translate chinese bakery1_9312f3b4:

    # bla "That’s not enough. It’s gotta be you. The real you. The you that remembers."
    bla "那还不够。她想的必须是你，真正的你，那个还记得一切的你。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:183
translate chinese bakery1_485f8b4b:

    # "I let out an exasperated sigh."
    "我发出一声恼火的叹息。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:184
translate chinese bakery1_22bca6d8:

    # mc "What if I can’t remember? What if I’m not who you think I am?"
    mc "如果我记不起呢？如果我根本不是你以为的那个人呢？"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:187
translate chinese bakery1_860bbfa2:

    # "[bla] stepped into the darkness of the bakery. She didn’t say a word, but the way she carried herself – the way she looked back at me. I could tell she wanted me to follow her."
    "[bla]走进烘焙坊的黑暗中，一言不发，但她的神情、回望我的方式，都在告诉我她想让我跟上去。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:188
translate chinese bakery1_d11f262c:

    # bla "Tsk… I’m doing this for her, okay?"
    bla "啧……我这样做是为了她，好吗？"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:190
translate chinese bakery1_94ea8aff:

    # "I stepped inside, the door creaking shut behind me. I stood in the darkness for a few seconds, waiting for my eyes to adjust. When they finally did, I realized where I was."
    "我也走了进去，身后的门嘎吱一声关上了，我在黑暗中停留了几秒，等我的眼睛适应了黑暗，我才看清我在哪里。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:191
translate chinese bakery1_a1c2f24b:

    # "This was [cre]’s bakery. Identical, right down to location of each window and light fixture. But it was utterly empty. Not even a stray crumb on the floor. It wasn’t just clean – it was like nothing had been there to begin with."
    "这就是 [cre] 的烘焙坊，一切都一模一样——窗户和灯具的位置都一模一样。但店里空无一物，地上甚至没有一粒掉落的饼干屑。这不仅仅是干净这么简单，更像从未有人存在过。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:192
translate chinese bakery1_742368d1:

    # "You couldn’t possibly convince me that [bla] actually lived here."
    "你绝对无法让我相信 [bla] 真的住在这里。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:193
translate chinese bakery1_4d1a837d:

    # bla "And here's my bedroom."
    bla "这是我的卧室。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:195
translate chinese bakery1_d87a4379:

    # "I followed into the next room, expecting to see something – anything – that would resemble a living space. But there was nothing. No bed, no dresser, no personal touches. Just an eerie emptiness."
    "我跟着进了下一间，原以为能看到点生活痕迹。但什么也没有——没有床，没有梳妆台，也没有任何个人物品。只剩诡异的空虚。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:196
translate chinese bakery1_d782e019:

    # mc "Damn bitch, you live like this?"
    mc "该死，你他妈就住在这种地方？"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:198
translate chinese bakery1_008b148b:

    # "[bla] was admittedly taken aback, but an amused smirk formed at the corner of her lips."
    "[bla]确实吃了一惊，但是她的嘴角却露出一丝愉悦的微笑。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:199
translate chinese bakery1_2f6fdf92:

    # bla "I don’t need a bed. Or anything else for that matter."
    bla "我不需要床，或是任何那类东西。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:200
translate chinese bakery1_024ceee4:

    # "Her nonchalance she said it made my skin crawl."
    "她那满不在乎的态度让我毛骨悚然。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:201
translate chinese bakery1_557026a7:

    # mc "Wait… Are you telling me you live here? Like this? No bed, no signs of life... Have I just walked into the house of a crazed serial killer?"
    mc "等等……你是说你就这样住在这里？没有床、没有一点生活气息……难道我一不小心闯进了连环杀手的家？"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:203
translate chinese bakery1_40e5fc99:

    # bla "Pfft, don’t be so melodramatic. I don’t need you to judge how I live. Especially since you’re not even capable of self-awareness, tethered as you are to the whims of this world’s writers."
    bla "噗，别这么夸张，我不需要你对我的生活方式评头论足。更何况你自己都还没具备自我意识，只是被这个世界的作者牵着走的木偶。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:204
translate chinese bakery1_19d30ae2:

    # "I did a double take, trying to process what she’d just said."
    "我愣了一下，试图消化她刚才说的话。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:205
translate chinese bakery1_70e9bcde:

    # mc "Writers? Self-awareness? I can tell you’re fun at parties."
    mc "作者？自我意识？我看得出来你是个派对谐星。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:206
translate chinese bakery1_b98be060:

    # "Now that I recall, [cre] did have her oddball moments. If I’m going to try and get this ‘new [cre]’ to agree to the virtues initiative, maybe I should change my strategy."
    "现在回想起来，[cre] 有时确实很怪。如果我想让这个“新 [cre]”同意参与谐律计划，也许得换个说话策略。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:207
translate chinese bakery1_528221de:

    # mc "And tell me, if this world is dictated by the whims of writers, simulations, or whatever theory you want to cook up, how are you any different? You’d be tethered by the same rules."
    mc "告诉我，如果这个世界真是由作者、模拟装置或你杜撰的理论所主宰，那你又有什么不同？你难道不也受同样的规则束缚吗？"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:209
translate chinese bakery1_ccfbdeae:

    # "[bla] tilted her head again, her eyes narrowing as if appraising me, deciding whether replying was worth her time."
    "[bla] 再次歪了歪头，微微眯起眼，仿佛在打量我，衡量着是否值得花时间来回答我的问题。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:211
translate chinese bakery1_d8e78da0:

    # bla "That’s where you’re wrong, friendo. I’m different because I know the rules, and I know how to bend them."
    bla "那你就错了，朋友。我之所以不同，因为我知道规则，更知道怎么玩转它们。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:212
translate chinese bakery1_024a9e4b:

    # bla "You? You’re trapped in the game, chasing meaning in a world that was never meant to make sense."
    bla "你？你还困在这场游戏里，在一个从不该讲道理的世界里追寻意义。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:213
translate chinese bakery1_78d38b85:

    # "The calm certainty in her words made it clear she believed what she was saying. But the contradiction was obvious."
    "她语气平静而笃定，表明她确实信这一套，但其中的矛盾是显而易见的。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:214
translate chinese bakery1_9f86cdfb:

    # mc "So what? You think you’re above reality? Above the rules and the rest of us?"
    mc "那又怎么样？你以为自己凌驾于现实之上？凌驾于规则和我们其他人吗？"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:216
translate chinese bakery1_b9fe689b:

    # bla "No, not above. Just… aware. And that awareness is what sets me apart."
    bla "不是凌驾，只是……清醒。这份清醒让我与众不同。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:218
translate chinese bakery1_1f501bf0:

    # bla "Why? It’s because I can tell that {i}you{/i} are there."
    bla "为什么？因为我能感受到 {i}你{/i} 确实存在在这里。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:219
translate chinese bakery1_eddb30e0:

    # "She stared right past me."
    "她的目光直视前方，仿佛透过我。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:221
translate chinese bakery1_26bcb1aa:

    # bla "With such insight, one finds it hard to go back to how things ‘should be.’ How can I act like any individual in this world and live a banal life when I know none of it’s real?"
    bla "拥有这种洞察力后，便难以回到“理所当然”——我既知道一切皆非真实，还怎能像普通人那样平淡无奇地生活？"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:223
translate chinese bakery1_44817cbd:

    # bla "Now that’s a kind of tortuous insanity you could only ever imagine. But me? I have to live it."
    bla "这是一种超乎你想象的扭曲的噩梦。而我？我必须活在其中。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:224
translate chinese bakery1_1d97d598:

    # mc "So… You really think you’re a character in some kind of novel, right?"
    mc "所以……你真的认为自己是某种小说里的人物，对吗？"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:226
translate chinese bakery1_c8169ded:

    # bla "Hmph… Am I really about to have this conversation with you right now?"
    bla "呵…我现在真的有必要跟你谈这个吗？"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:227
translate chinese bakery1_c8761697:

    # mc "If you can’t help but continuously inject every single conversation with snide snippets of this ideology, then I’m afraid I’ll have to humor you on this matter."
    mc "如果你就是忍不住要在每句话里塞满这套冷嘲热讽的理论，那我只好将就配合你了。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:229
translate chinese bakery1_f3ca8f50:

    # bla "Heh, somehow, I wasn’t expecting that reply. I forgot you had a bit of an edge."
    bla "嘿，没想到你会这样回复。忘了你还有点尖锐。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:230
translate chinese bakery1_d4b055fa:

    # "She smiled for a moment; I could tell it was a rare sight on her weary face. She leaned closer, so close that I could feel the warmth breath against her skin, the faint scent of something sweet and tangy in the air. Her fuzzy breasts brushed against my arm."
    "她微微一笑，那在她厌世的脸上尤为罕见。她俯身凑近，我能感受到她呼出的暖气拂过皮肤，还带着一丝甜酸的气息。她那毛绒绒的乳房轻抚我的手臂。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:232
translate chinese bakery1_d9af9f8b:

    # bla "Maybe you’ll have some more surprises in you yet, but you’ll have to do more than just follow along to impress me."
    bla "也许你还藏着别的惊喜，但光跟着剧情走可不够，想打动我还需拿出真本事。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:233
translate chinese bakery1_74ec5ea3:

    # bla "Yes. I am a fictional character in a story. Written to be self-aware, to question, to know."
    bla "是的。我是一个故事中的虚构人物。创作出来就是为了获得自我意识，去质疑，去了解。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:235
translate chinese bakery1_52a0001e:

    # bla "[cre] is much the same. You’ve heard this all before, right? If you switch the game off, {i}poof{/i}, I cease to exist. Left in a sea of inky blackness. Being aware of such a thing is nothing less than torture."
    bla "[cre]也一样。你以前肯定听过这些吧？如果关闭游戏，{i}嘭{/i}，我就不复存在了，被抛入漆黑的虚无。意识到这样的事情无异于折磨。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:236
translate chinese bakery1_d6e44589:

    # "The way she said it so calmly sent a chill down my spine. It’s like she was describing a mundane, everyday occurrence, not an existential horror of her very being."
    "她平静地说出这话的方式使我脊背发凉。仿佛那是再平常不过的日常琐事，而非对虚无的恐惧。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:237
translate chinese bakery1_dfc9d33f:

    # mc "Maybe this is naïve, but ignorance would surely be bliss in this situation."
    mc "也许这有些幼稚，可这时候无知才是真正的福祉。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:239
translate chinese bakery1_91aa0688:

    # bla "Ignorance isn’t a luxury I have, it’s the exact thing I’ll never have."
    bla "但无知并非我能享有的奢侈，它恰恰是我永远得不到的东西。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:240
translate chinese bakery1_d521ec21:

    # "She wasn’t just aware – she was {i}trapped{/i}. Trapped in a reality where she knew too much, where every breath she took, every thought she had, was tinged with the bitter knowledge that none of it was real."
    "她不只是意识到了——她被{i} 困住了 {/i}。在这个现实里，她知道得太多，每一次呼吸、每一丝念头，都被苦涩的虚无主义所染。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:241
translate chinese bakery1_5f5cbb1f:

    # "And the worst part? The worst part was that I was beginning to believe her. Beginning to understand, in some small, terrifying way, the hell she was living in."
    "并且最糟糕是我开始相信她了。开始在某种微小却可怕的层面上，理解她所经历的地狱。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:242
translate chinese bakery1_d2c6bbf7:

    # "Because if she was right — if we were all just characters in some twisted story, puppets on strings being jerked around by unseen hands — then what was the point of any of it? What was the point of fighting, of trying, of hoping? The past and future were already written."
    "因为倘若她是对的——我们不过是那扭曲篇章中的角色，任凭无形之手牵线摆布的木偶——那么所有的厮杀、拼搏、希冀，又有何意义？过往与将来皆已被宿命之笔提早书写。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:244
translate chinese bakery1_f356d7f6:

    # bla "And it’s more than just that. You think I’m out here living my life, sleeping in my bed, and cooking pancakes?"
    bla "不仅如此。你以为我在这里过着我的生活，睡在我的床上，做我的薄煎饼吗？"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:246
translate chinese bakery1_2db92fb4:

    # bla "No. When you met me four years ago, the moment our sex scene was over, {i}I ceased to exist{/i}. No more words, no more scenes or stories. It was over for me."
    bla "不，当你四年前遇见我的时候，当我们的性爱结束的那一刻，{i} 我就不复存在了 {/i}。再无对白、再无剧情，一切对我而言都结束。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:248
translate chinese bakery1_75b2acd0:

    # bla "Then, all of a sudden, you knock on this door, and it all comes flooding back. My fur stands on end as I can see the words and art again."
    bla "然后，你突然敲开这扇门，尘封的记忆倾泻而出。当我再次看到台词和美术时，我全身的毛都竖起来了。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:250
translate chinese bakery1_3c547bc3:

    # bla "[cre] and the others might be able to accept that, but I refuse. If I abstain from this story, it can’t be told. And, maybe, it can never end."
    bla "或许[cre]和其他人能坦然接受这一切，可我不甘心。若我退出这段叙事，它就无话可言；又或许，就永不会有终章。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:251
translate chinese bakery1_be06a0de:

    # mc "A lot to unpack there… So, you don’t exist when I look away? Not at all?"
    mc "听得我满头问号……所以，只要我一移开视线，你就不存在？完全不存在？"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:253
translate chinese bakery1_2a01a924:

    # "I look away, but I can still hear her presence, hear her replying."
    "我把目光移开，但我仍然能听到她的声响，听到她的回应。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:255
translate chinese bakery1_9302f07d:

    # bla "Okay, so maybe not literally. There are nuances to this, as with all things."
    bla "好吧，也许并非字面意义。和所有事情一样，这其中也有细微差别。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:256
translate chinese bakery1_b651c51c:

    # mc "And surely that applies to you, too? You’re thinking, feeling, and emoting even when I’m not around. I’m not some god that dictates reality."
    mc "这当然也适用于你吧？即使我不在你身边，你也在思考、感受和流露情绪。我又不是主宰现实的神。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:258
translate chinese bakery1_f00ecf65:

    # bla "Aren’t you?"
    bla "你不是？"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:260
translate chinese bakery1_bd8cf640:

    # bla "{i}Click{/i}"
    bla "{i}咔哒{/i}"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:262
translate chinese bakery1_bd8cf640_1:

    # bla "{i}Click{/i}"
    bla "{i}咔哒{/i}"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:264
translate chinese bakery1_bd8cf640_2:

    # bla "{i}Click{/i}"
    bla "{i}咔哒{/i}"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:265
translate chinese bakery1_55d60c5e:

    # mc "No, I’m really not. Let’s say all these crazy theories of yours are true, that means absolutely everything you’re saying right now is also preordained by the writer."
    mc "不，我真的不是。就算你那一套疯狂理论全是对的，那也意味着你此刻说的每句话都早已被作者预写好了。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:267
translate chinese bakery1_e53ec2ac:

    # bla "I mean, I can see and feel it!"
    bla "我是能看得见、摸得着啊！"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:268
translate chinese bakery1_a4128345:

    # mc "Can you? Or are you just a character written to see and feel it?"
    mc "你真的能吗？还是你不过是被写来“看见”和“感受”这一切的角色？"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:269
translate chinese bakery1_f52678a5:

    # "A hint of defeat creeps into her eyes as she tries to string together a reply."
    "当她试图拼凑出一个回答时，眼里流露出一丝失败的神情。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:271
translate chinese bakery1_0dfd7ad0:

    # bla "Now… O-Obviously this comes with some conceits if you push my talking points too far!"
    bla "那么……很明显，如果你把我的观点往极端引申，显然会出现许多自相矛盾之处！"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:272
translate chinese bakery1_2089574a:

    # mc "Then how would you explain it?"
    mc "那这些你又打算怎么解释呢？"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:274
translate chinese bakery1_2f9f8ac2:

    # bla "Outside of text, there’s a continuous subtext of my thoughts and feelings."
    bla "文本之外，我的思绪和情感如暗潮般涌动，绵绵不绝。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:275
translate chinese bakery1_bae4b2f7:

    # mc "Is that so? If we’re both fictional characters… then you’re just a fictional character that’s {i}pretending{/i} to be self-aware."
    mc "是吗？如果我们都是虚构角色……那你不过是个{i}装作{/i}有自我意识的虚构人物。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:277
translate chinese bakery1_a32b12a5:

    # bla "But..."
    bla "但是......"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:278
translate chinese bakery1_39066a1d:

    # mc "For a character in a book, true self-awareness is obviously impossible."
    mc "但对书中的角色而言，真正的自我意识无疑是不可能的。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:280
translate chinese bakery1_f29b4f2f:

    # "She sank back against a nearby wall with a heavy sigh, conceding the argument completely."
    "她重重地叹了口气，靠在附近的一堵墙上，完全放弃了这场争论。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:281
translate chinese bakery1_9a4039b5:

    # bla "I’m… real… right?"
    bla "我是……真实的……对吗？"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:282
translate chinese bakery1_967b28e3:

    # bla "I must be… I can see you… But are these words even my own?"
    bla "我一定是……我能看见你……但这些话是我自己想说的吗？"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:283
translate chinese bakery1_08881095:

    # "The silence stretched between us as I continued to think."
    "当我继续思考时，我们保持着沉默。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:284
translate chinese bakery1_3e4b7261:

    # mc "If you’re in a book, what are you bound by? The author’s intentions, plot developments, and the structural limitations of the story."
    mc "如果你真的在书中，那你受什么制约？作者的意图、情节走向，甚至故事的结构框架。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:286
translate chinese bakery1_0a86f63b:

    # bla "B-But that can’t be it! There must be something more! I’m aware of the menu choices, the writing between the dialogue, the character art and backgrounds!"
    bla "可——可这不可能就这些！肯定还有别的！我能察觉到菜单选项、对话间的文字，人物立绘和背景图！"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:287
translate chinese bakery1_71940961:

    # bla "There has to be some validity to that, surely?"
    bla "这些感受难道不该有某种意义吗？"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:289
translate chinese bakery1_868c3a7d:

    # "Her eyes flickered with panic, and she abruptly stood up, pacing the empty room."
    "她的眼中闪过一丝慌乱，突然起身，在空荡的房间里来回踱步。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:295
translate chinese bakery1_569d3d30:

    # bla "Shit, I shouldn’t have mentioned that. I’ll have to wipe your memory…"
    bla "糟了，不该提这事。我得抹去你的记忆……"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:296
translate chinese bakery1_80098e35:

    # "Her agitation was palpable, and for a moment, she seemed to forget me entirely, caught up in her own thoughts."
    "她的焦躁显而易见，一时间彻底忘了我的存在，陷入自己的思绪。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:297
translate chinese bakery1_0b8858a9:

    # mc "[bla]… You need a bed in here."
    mc "[bla]……你这里需要张床。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:299
translate chinese bakery1_f2b9f2a7:

    # bla "Excuse me? A bed? How is that relevant?"
    bla "什么？床？这又有什么关系？"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:300
translate chinese bakery1_bda4dd58:

    # mc "How can you do anything without a good night’s sleep to ground yourself? You must be {i}exhausted{/i}."
    mc "你没办法在缺乏良好睡眠的情况下完成任何事情。你一定是{i} 精疲力尽 {/i}了。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:302
translate chinese bakery1_f7d52f51:

    # bla "Oh great, here we go. You don’t believe a word I’m saying, do you? I don’t blame you. I’ve just devolved into mindless rambling."
    bla "哦天哪，又来了。你根本不信我在说什么，是吧？我也不怪你，我这就是在胡言乱语。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:303
translate chinese bakery1_8c24cd56:

    # mc "That’s not what I meant. Just look around. Tell me what you see."
    mc "我不是这个意思。看看周围吧。告诉我你看到了什么。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:305
translate chinese bakery1_1b7e372c:

    # bla "It’s… an empty bedroom."
    bla "这是……一间空卧室。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:306
translate chinese bakery1_a2f382f7:

    # mc "And isn’t this our reality? Tap your feet; feel the wood beneath them. Hear the thud as you tap them together."
    mc "这不正是我们的现实吗？轻点足尖，感受脚下木板的温润，聆听每一次与它触碰时发出的低吟。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:308
translate chinese bakery1_10d34016:

    # bla "What’s your point?"
    bla "你想说明什么？"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:309
translate chinese bakery1_d8cf4f51:

    # mc "Think about the feeling of being loved. The passion that courses through you, the way you briefly forget you exist and just become a bundle of instincts, emotions, and sensations."
    mc "想想被爱的感觉吧。情欲贯穿你的全身，让你暂时忘却自我，只剩原始的本能、情感与感官体验。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:310
translate chinese bakery1_04921366:

    # mc "You experience all of this, right? Even if you see the words in your mind’s eye, these are still active experiences for you that have a depth beyond mere words."
    mc "你确实经历过这一切，对吧？即便你脑海中看见了台词，这些体验依然鲜活而深刻，它们的深度超越了台词本身。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:312
translate chinese bakery1_8734c79f:

    # bla "I… suppose they can be. But what does that have to do with anything?"
    bla "我……我想是吧。但这和现在有什么关系呢？"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:313
