translate chinese bakery1_00179606:

    # mc "I helped her see that, to reclaim some sense of reality. She still thinks we’re in a book, but she seems resolved to seek a life beyond of its pages."
    mc "我就是帮她看清了这一点，让她重新重视现实。她依旧认为我们在书中，但她似乎下定了决心要越出字里行间，活出自我。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:619
translate chinese bakery1_66f9c15d:

    # mox "Wow, uh… That’s a bit beyond my {i}reading{/i} comprehension."
    mox "哇，呃……，这有点超出了我的{i} 阅读 {/i}理解力。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:620
translate chinese bakery1_241433e8:

    # mc "Evidently not so far beyond your need to make a pun!"
    mc "显然还没超出你讲双关语的本能！"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:621
translate chinese bakery1_d208e0d1:

    # mc "The silver lining is that she’s determined to push through it and live a fulfilling life, no matter what she sees or experiences."
    mc "幸运的是，无论她看到或经历了什么，她都决心克服困难，过上充实的生活。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:623
translate chinese bakery1_f9fc171e:

    # mox "Ain’t that the truth? Finding a way to keep on, no matter the weight on your shoulders, that’s what it comes down to."
    mox "真理就是，不管你肩上所背负的有多沉重，坚持不懈就是解决问题的关键。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:625
translate chinese bakery1_af6ac0e2:

    # mox "You’ve always had a knack for helping folks see the forest through the trees. But tell me, how are you really? Today sounds like it was crazy."
    mox "你总是有一种帮助人们透过树木看到森林的本领。但说真心话，你今天还好吗？听起来挺疯狂的。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:626
translate chinese bakery1_7a9d215f:

    # mc "Yeah, it was heavy. She was so sure, so certain everything's on strings being pulled by something bigger. Makes it hard not to get lost in that."
    mc "是的，有点沉重。她太笃定了，坚信一切都被更高的存在操控着。那种感觉让人很容易迷茫。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:628
translate chinese bakery1_738d5caf:

    # mox "But you’re here. You’re flesh and blood to me, and that’s what counts."
    mox "但你现在在我面前，你对我来说是真实存在的，有血有肉的，这才是最重要的。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:629
translate chinese bakery1_a2be4e9d:

    # mc "I reckon you’re right. It’s less about what’s written and more about the paths we choose to walk down after it's all said and done."
    mc "你说得对，比起所谓的‘剧本’，更重要的是我们选择走下去的路。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:631
translate chinese bakery1_6cea486c:

    # mox "Damn straight. And from where I’m sitting, you’re walking it just fine."
    mox "说的太对了。并且从我看来，你选得很好。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:632
translate chinese bakery1_18ce96e5:

    # mc "Thanks, [mox]. You always know how to put things in perspective."
    mc "谢谢你，[mox]。你总能一语点醒梦中人。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:634
translate chinese bakery1_bec836be:

    # mox "Gab is one of my few gifts. Now, what do you say to a midnight snack? Something warm, something easy."
    mox "口才是我为数不多的天赋之一。现在，你觉得来点宵夜怎么样？来点温暖的，简单的料理。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:636
translate chinese bakery1_f38f7b53:

    # "As we moved towards the kitchen, [mox]’s hand found mine. A small, grounding gesture, reminding me that no matter what strange currents were stirring in this world, there was still this, moments to hold onto and savor."
    "我们往厨房走去，途中[mox]握住了我的手。一个小小的、简单的举动，提醒我，无论这个世界上有多少暗流汹涌，仍然有这样的时刻，值得品味并为之坚持下去。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:637
translate chinese bakery1_d81a0a1f:

    # "And that was enough."
    "并且这就已经足够了。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:647
translate chinese bakery2_4e1b07b2:

    # "I follow the familiar route to the bakery, expecting the same rundown sight as before — until I stop in my tracks. The bakery is..."
    "我沿着熟悉的路线再次前往烘焙坊，原本预期还会看到那副破败模样——却猛然停下了脚步。眼前的烘焙坊……"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:649
translate chinese bakery2_fe3f55c1:

    # "The storefront gleams under the moonlight, almost unrecognizable. Its once weathered front has been completely transformed, polished and inviting, like something out of a dream I can’t fully remember."
    "在月光下熠熠生辉。那曾经破旧的外墙已焕然一新，干净又温暖，仿佛存在于某个模糊的梦境中。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:652
translate chinese bakery2_50b17567:

    # "I step inside. The smell hits me first, fresh bread, pastries, that sweetness I missed before hanging in the air."
    "我走进屋内，首先扑面而来的是那熟悉的香气——新鲜的面包、点心，弥漫在空气之中。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:653
translate chinese bakery2_2d2fba22:

    # "The shelves are stocked full, cakes and pies, everything neat and perfect."
    "架子上摆得满满当当，蛋糕与派整齐诱人，十分完美。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:655
translate chinese bakery2_a57ad674:

    # "I can’t help but stop, staring in awe, as a smug [bla] watches."
    "我不由得停下脚步，惊叹地望着这一切，而[bla]带着得意的神情站在那里看着我。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:656
translate chinese bakery2_41c390a7:

    # mc "But… The bare walls, the thick dust… It doesn’t make any sense. It looks incredible, but… how?"
    mc "但……那些光秃秃的墙壁，那厚厚的灰尘……这说不通啊，简直不可思议，到底……是怎么做到的？"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:658
translate chinese bakery2_f5d05372:

    # "[bla] steps from behind the counter, almost glowing with pride, like the bakery’s rebirth has been one for her too."
    "[bla]从柜台后走出来，散发着骄傲的光芒，这家店的重生也象征着她自身的蜕变。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:659
translate chinese bakery2_41724657:

    # bla "Quite the transformation, isn’t it? Hehe. But I didn’t do it alone. I had some help from my friends, and they’re quite eager to meet you."
    bla "变化很大吧？嘿嘿～不过我可不是一个人做到的。我有朋友帮忙，他们也很想见你呢。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:660
translate chinese bakery2_ccc59eba:

    # mc "Friends? Not to be rude, but I didn’t expect you to have connections quite like this. I mean, {i}wow{/i}!"
    mc "朋友？没别的意思，但我真没想到你会有这么广的人脉。简直……{i}哇哦{/i}！"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:662
translate chinese bakery2_fef9628c:

    # bla "Haha, haven’t you figured out that I’m full of surprises?"
    bla "哈哈，你还没发现我总是充满惊喜吗？"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:663
translate chinese bakery2_569ea05f:

    # mc "You can say that again. I’m looking forward to finally learning more about you."
    mc "那倒是。我也很期待能更多地了解你。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:665
translate chinese bakery2_a0e0bbcd:

    # bla "Ah, but first, you just {i}have{/i} to try some of my delicious baked goods! You’re not the first customer, but your feedback will be invaluable."
    bla "不过，在那之前，你{i}必须{/i}先尝尝我的手艺！你不是第一个顾客，但你的反馈最重要。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:666
translate chinese bakery2_23af6a09:

    # "As she hands me an impeccably decorated, fluffy cupcake, I can’t help but consider just how much [bla]’s personality seems to have softened. Good for her. I’m glad she’s feeling better."
    "她递给我一个精致诱人的纸杯蛋糕，我不禁注意到——[bla]的性格真的温柔了许多。对她来说，这是好事，我发自内心为她感到高兴。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:667
translate chinese bakery2_c049ac77:

    # "{i}Munch{/i} I take a bite and… This is a good fucking cupcake!"
    "{i}咬一口{/i}……妈耶，这蛋糕太好吃了！"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:668
translate chinese bakery2_e44d7d9d:

    # mc "You’re a complete natural! Just like [cre] was."
    mc "你简直是天生好手！就跟[cre]一样。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:670
translate chinese bakery2_a92311d1:

    # bla "Heh, I know… Speaking of [cre], there’s something I’ve been dying to talk to you about. You see, I spoke with [cre] about what you said."
    bla "呵，我知道……说到[cre]，我有件事一直想跟你谈。我跟她说了你的观点。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:671
translate chinese bakery2_70fda843:

    # mc "Y-You did?!"
    mc "你……你真的跟她说了？！"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:673
translate chinese bakery2_ae7b10db:

    # bla "I really wished I could wholeheartedly accept everything you said, but I was torn."
    bla "我真的很希望自己能彻底相信你说的每句话，但我心里仍有挣扎。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:675
translate chinese bakery2_67da75b8:

    # bla "How could I consolidate the idea that I exist in a living, breathing world, with the fact there's a reader; a godlike being capable of saving, loading, pausing, going backwards, going forwards… The ideas just seem completely incompatible, don’t they?"
    bla "我该如何同时相信自己活在一个真实的世界中，却又不得不承认存在一个读者——一个可以保存、加载、暂停、倒带、快进的神……这些想法是互斥的，对吧？"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:676
translate chinese bakery2_0d382d4f:

    # mc "Whoa... No easing me into this today, huh? That’s a lot to hit me with after a cupcake."
    mc "哇哦……今天不打算给我点缓冲啊？这纸杯蛋糕还没吃完就来。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:678
translate chinese bakery2_e573eead:

    # bla "That's just how I roll, baby~"
    bla "我一向这样，宝贝～"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:679
translate chinese bakery2_f507eeb7:

    # mc "You’re really putting a lot of weight on this idea of a player or reader controlling reality, but... I have to wonder how important that really is."
    mc "我发现你很在意‘玩家’操控现实这件事，但……这真很重要吗？"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:680
translate chinese bakery2_6c1e00db:

    # mc "Granted, imagining a reader controlling things with powers far beyond our own is a little unsettling."
    mc "说实话，想象有个‘玩家’操控着一切，确实让人坐立不安。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:681
translate chinese bakery2_39513869:

    # mc "But at the same time, does it really make any difference? Does it change how beautiful the sunset is just to look at - does it stop you from living your life?"
    mc "但同时，它真的会有什么实际影响吗？比如，那美丽的夕阳——光是看着它，不就已经足够了吗？难道它妨碍你继续生活吗？"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:683
translate chinese bakery2_4e5d3f04:

    # bla "That's what I want to know.... Do I stop existing when they stop reading? When they close the game?"
    bla "这正是我想知道的……如果他们不再阅读，我会消失吗？他们关掉游戏时，我是否就不复存在？"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:684
translate chinese bakery2_6234455b:

    # bla "If you close the game, do I temporarily cease to exist? I used to think I did. But now, I’m not so sure..."
    bla "如果你关掉了游戏，我是不是就暂时消失了？我以前真的这么认为。但现在……我不太确定了……"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:686
translate chinese bakery2_dee24414:

    # mc "But... wouldn't that imply that you don't exist until the reader starts?"
    mc "可……那不就意味着，在‘玩家’开始游玩之前，你根本不存在？"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:688
translate chinese bakery2_8fca7e68:

    # bla "I’ve thought about it — a lot. And I think you're right. My world can't freeze because you're not the only one reading this story anymore."
    bla "我确实反反复复想过这个问题。现在我觉得你是对的，这个世界不会就此暂停或消失，因为不仅仅只有一个人游玩这些剧情。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:690
translate chinese bakery2_88d6360b:

    # bla "One player may never finish the story. One player may never even start the story. But there are hundreds of others out there."
    bla "有的‘玩家’可能永远不会走完所有剧情，有的甚至可能永远不会开始，但还有成百上千的其他‘玩家’。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:692
translate chinese bakery2_46f945a0:

    # bla "Countless people reading, all at different times. Heck, even the developer could be skipping through it now, testing for bugs!"
    bla "无数人在不同时间游玩，或许连‘开发者’现在也正跳过对话，测试着哪有 bug 呢！"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:694
translate chinese bakery2_a5484337:

    # bla "The story's contents are fixed. If you reload this conversation, I'd be none-the-wiser. And don't you think that's a huge contradiction?"
    bla "剧情的内容是固定的。如果你重新加载这段对话，我不可能知道。但你不觉得这本身就有巨大的矛盾吗？"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:695
translate chinese bakery2_822aa5c3:

    # mc "How so?"
    mc "怎么说？"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:696
translate chinese bakery2_6358ec23:

    # bla "If I could really, genuinely break the fourth wall, wouldn't I know if this is your second, or third reading through this story? And with that in mind, there's no way my dialogue would be exactly the same as the first time, right?"
    bla "如果我真能打破第四面墙，那我不该知道这是第几次玩家读到这段话吗？如果如此，我说的话又怎么可能每次都一模一样？"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:698
translate chinese bakery2_dfadaedc:

    # bla "You were right. You were absolutely right. This story is just a singular documented instance of time."
    bla "对啊，你说的没错。我现在明白了：这个故事不过是某一段时光的单一记录。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:699
translate chinese bakery2_d02b6395:

    # bla "And thinking that way separates me from the medium in a way that lets me exist outside of it too."
    bla "而用这样的角度来思考，让我的主观意识抽身而出，存在于文本剧情之外。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:700
translate chinese bakery2_ddcd40c9:

    # bla "This story you’re reading is a linear experience, strictly a documentation of our first and second meetings, told in a linear fashion."
    bla "时间与剧情都是线性的，而剧情本身却非连续，它只记录了我们的初见和再会。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:701
translate chinese bakery2_ae0bbd1c:

    # mc "Ah, I get it! This story is like a play, recorded on a loop. No matter how many times it’s played back, the actors always say the same lines, make the same choices. But behind the scenes? That’s where the real story lives."
    mc "啊，我懂了！剧情就像一部被录下来的舞台剧。无论播放多少次，演员说的台词、做出的选择始终如一，但真正的故事藏在幕布之后。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:702
translate chinese bakery2_f983e242:

    # mc "I mean, if the actors could react through the video, what would that be, the fifth wall?"
    mc "要是演员还能透过录像回应观众，那叫什么，第五面墙？"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:704
translate chinese bakery2_cb727a4a:

    # bla "Bah, fuck if I know. All I know is, I think I’m getting closer to living comfortably in my own skin."
    bla "呃，鬼知道，反正我知道了一件事，我终于能安心地做自己了。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:705
translate chinese bakery2_40c81adf:

    # bla "I know I'm in a game, but now I know that I'm so much more than just that game."
    bla "我知道自己存在于游戏中，但我也知道，我早就超越‘游戏角色’了。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:707
translate chinese bakery2_f1cb34ea:

    # bla "But before I chew your ear off anymore. It’s time for me to do some explaining. You deserve to know why I know so much about you."
    bla "不过在我继续喋喋不休之前。是时候你有权知道我为什么对你了如指掌了。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:708
translate chinese bakery2_46e487f3:

    # mc "I don’t want to say ‘finally’, but… {i}finally{/i}!"
    mc "我不想说‘终于’，但……{i}终于{/i}！"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:710
translate chinese bakery2_06ed97a0:

    # bla "Fantastic! Follow me... It's time you saw what's really behind the stage's curtains."
    bla "太好了！跟我来吧……是时候让你看看窗帘后面了。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:713
translate chinese bakery2_20e1f54a:

    # "I’m not sure what to expect, but I hope I can get some answers today so I can understand [bla] a little better."
    "我不知道接下来会看到什么，但我真心希望，今天能得到一些答案，让我更了解[bla]一点。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:714
translate chinese bakery2_851bc174:

    # "She leads me through the house, past rooms that are now lightly furnished instead of completely empty."
    "她带我穿过屋子，经过那些如今稍微装饰过的房间，不再像之前那样空荡荡的。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:716
translate chinese bakery2_82dbeb8d:

    # "We step into the bedroom, finally complete with a bed, although it could still use a little more furniture here and there."
    "我们走进卧室，总算有了张床，虽然房间整体仍有点简陋。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:717
translate chinese bakery2_39e674d8:

    # "I wish I could say I was focused on that part of this room more, but the curtain from before steals the show."
    "我本该关注这些新变化，但那块窗帘才是真正的焦点。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:719
translate chinese bakery2_b375436e:

    # "Without a word, she pulls it aside, revealing an impossibly long corridor that stretches into the dark."
    "她一言不发地拉开帘子，露出那条不可思议的走廊，笔直延伸进黑暗深处。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:721
translate chinese bakery2_fd1114c9:

    # bla "Are you ready?"
    bla "准备好了吗？"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:722
translate chinese bakery2_52777c65:

    # mc "As long as the mysterious, impossible corridor is safe."
    mc "只要那条神秘的走廊是安全的。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:724
translate chinese bakery2_74ae759b:

    # bla "Hehe, safer in there than it is here."
    bla "嘿嘿，里面比这里还安全哦～"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:726
translate chinese bakery2_9e3a70af:

    # "She steps forward, leading the way, disappearing further into whatever waits on the other side."
    "她带头前行，身影渐渐消失在那未知的深处。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:733
translate chinese bakery2_310fd1cf:

    # "The corridor stretched on. Even though it was perfectly straight, it felt like it twisted in on itself, the space around me folding in ways I couldn’t explain, like I was moving and standing still at once."
    "走廊延伸着。虽然笔直，却给人一种扭曲的错觉，空间仿佛在我周围折叠、旋转，说不清我是正在前进，还是仍在原地。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:734
translate chinese bakery2_0ad4d27e:

    # "We came to a door at the end of the corridor. Its edges glowed faintly, pulsing alive with otherworldly light."
    "我们来到走廊尽头的一扇门前，门缝微微发光，有某种异界的光芒在闪烁。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:736
translate chinese bakery2_f780cb5d:

    # "[bla] turned to me with a smirk."
    "[bla]回头，嘴角带着一抹坏笑。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:737
translate chinese bakery2_01c01095:

    # bla "What you’re about to see will make no sense, it’ll seem impossible… But, eh, I think you can handle it~"
    bla "你接下来要看到的东西完全不合常理，看起来根本不可能。但是，我想你应该应付得来～"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:741
translate chinese bakery2_78ca78a1:

    # "She pushed the door open without any hesitation, and what I saw beyond was indeed nothing short of impossible."
    "她毫不犹豫地推开门，而门后展现出来的景象，确实超乎想象。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:742
translate chinese bakery2_fff007a0:

    # "A room stretched out, endless, defying any logic. I couldn’t see the end, everything blurred into mere colours into the horizon."
    "房间向外延伸，无边无际，彻底违背了常理。我看不见尽头，一切在远方逐渐模糊，化作颜色与光影。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:743
translate chinese bakery2_140825aa:

    # "Through windows, I could see mountains and a beach that stretched on until the horizon, the sight fully cementing that I’m no longer in Arcadia."
    "透过窗子，我看见连绵的群山和延伸到天际的海滩，这里已经不在Arcadia了。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:744
translate chinese bakery2_cc415180:

    # "When I focused on what was nearby, the room felt intimate, decorated and fully furnished."
    "当我将目光收回至近处，才发现房间温馨而熟悉，布置精细，并且有居住痕迹。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:745
translate chinese bakery2_9a4a2722:

    # mc "Where on earth are we? This can’t be in the bakery, or underground."
    mc "天啊……我们到底在哪里？这里绝不可能是烘焙坊，更不可能在地下。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:747
translate chinese bakery2_5786bf4f:

    # "[bla] was calm, all this was clearly familiar to her."
    "[bla]却异常平静，显然她早就熟悉这一切。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:749
translate chinese bakery2_b0b14a5c:

    # bla "We call it a 'Nexus' and it exists outside of normal space. I guess the closest thing you could call it is ‘magic’, but… it’s not quite that."
    bla "我们称这里为枢纽中心，它不属于任何一个正常的空间。你可以说它是‘魔法’，但……又不完全是。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:750
translate chinese bakery2_cb4b1948:

    # mc "And just how long is this room?"
    mc "那这房间到底有多长？"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:752
translate chinese bakery2_40e90700:

    # bla "The room doesn’t have a ‘length,’ it just goes on forever in all directions."
    bla "它没有‘长度’的概念。它向所有方向无限延伸。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:754
translate chinese bakery2_319247d2:

    # bla "Everything nearby is ‘local’, so I recommend you stay close to my room, and my door."
    bla "这里是所谓的‘本地区域’，所以我建议你尽量待在我房间附近。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:756
translate chinese bakery2_ca248904:

    # "Local? Her part? Quite quickly, I began to notice them – others curiously stepping into sight."
    "本地？她的部分？我很快注意到——一些身影正好奇地走来。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:757
translate chinese bakery2_ed569fcf:

    # "They were all like [bla], like [cre], but… not quite."
    "她们一个个都像[bla]，也像[cre]，但……又不完全相同。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:758
translate chinese bakery2_e4f9245d:

    # "Then I realized that there was a dozen, maybe more. All mares, almost identical in shape and form, but each with subtle differences. One had a scar cutting across her cheek. Another’s mane was streaked with a fiery red. Another was a unicorn wearing a small silver pendant."
    "我突然意识到，房间里完全不止十几位雌驹，她们身形几乎一致，不尽相同。有的脸颊上有一道伤疤；有的鬃毛带着火红色的挑染；还有一个独角兽戴着小巧的银吊坠。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:760
translate chinese bakery2_d2a97bde:

    # bla "These are my other selves from adjacent universe. They’re the ones that helped sort out my bakery!"
    bla "她们是来自邻近宇宙的‘我’，是她们帮我一起打理的烘焙坊！"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:768
translate chinese bakery2_d077a249:

    # "One of them, the one with the scar approached me first, tilting her head with a mischievous glint in her eye."
    "人群中，脸颊带疤的那位率先走过来，眼中闪着调皮，歪头打量着我。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:770
translate chinese bakery2_8ff4e71d:

    # misc "Yar, so you’re the one everyone’s been fussing about. I missed ye the first time, traveler."
    misc "哎哟我去～你就是大家伙念叨半天那谁啊？上回我是真没瞅着你，老弟！"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:780
translate chinese bakery2_7c3d9de8:

    # misc "Greetings! It’s my pleasure to finally meet you, united one. The ladies of these universes speak ever so highly of you."
    misc "您好！吾辈荣幸之至，终得一睹尊颜。诸位宇宙淑女对您推崇备至。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:781
translate chinese bakery2_f291dcd4:

    # mc "Uhm, hello!"
    mc "额，你好。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:785
translate chinese bakery2_843acb62:

    # "Further words failed me in the face of what I was seeing. Each one had their own personality, their own way of carrying themselves. It was surreal."
    "面对眼前所见，我一时间竟无法组织语言。她们每一个都有自己的性格、气场与风格，仿佛梦境，却又无比真实。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:786
translate chinese bakery2_b9a6d695:

    # bla "Every version of myself from every fictional world operates from here. I’m not sure how, or why, but when we’re first authored into existence, this in-between reality is just a part of us."
    bla "每一个来自虚构世界的我都会在这里活动。不清楚为什么，但当我们诞生时，这个‘夹缝’就随之诞生，成为我们的一部分。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:787
translate chinese bakery2_165d2968:

    # bla "I dare say that every other character has something like this too. They’re just not aware of it."
    bla "我敢说其他角色大概也有类似的空间，只不过他们不知道罢了。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:788
translate chinese bakery2_fc029c1a:

    # mc "This is a room of infinite [cre] and infinite universes, then? Sheesh… Where do I even begin to process or understand that?"
    mc "所以……这是一个属于无限个平行宇宙中无限个[cre]的房间？天呐……这该如何理解？"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:790
translate chinese bakery2_f364d075:

    # bla "To understand it, we can start small. This room looks infinitely long, but look closer, it’s several smaller rooms connected together."
    bla "要理解它，我们可以从细微处入手。看起来这房间无限延展，但仔细想想，其实是由一间间小房间连在一起的。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:791
translate chinese bakery2_0be8b968:

    # "I look around and she’s right, each room not only has unique décor matching the personality of the occupant and universe, but there even are double doors that can be closed for privacy."
    "我环顾四周，她说得没错，每个房间都布置得独具特色，与所属宇宙和居住者的性格相匹配，甚至每间房都有双开门，可以保留隐私。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:792
translate chinese bakery2_21a0cb23:

    # mc "And each of these rooms has a door to that universe?"
    mc "而这些房间的每一扇门，通往的就是所属宇宙？"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:794
translate chinese bakery2_e9dec8b2:

    # bla "That is correct. The piratey version of me over there is from universe where Arcadia is a sea locked cluster of islands, with pirates, marines and much more."
    bla "没错，比如那边那个海盗版本的我，来自一个Arcadia被海洋环绕的宇宙——那里有海盗，有舰队，还有各种海上势力。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:795
translate chinese bakery2_be0da78b:

    # bla "The unicorn version of me is from a universe where the main cast are all part of a magical college, with an even more whimsical and excess usage of magic."
    bla "那位独角兽版本的我，来自另一个宇宙，那里的主要角色都在一所魔法学院里，魔法的运用的奇幻又夸张。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:796
translate chinese bakery2_bc27ce41:

    # "As she talks, I can feel a flood of memories coming back. This is where I first met [bla], I can remember it now!"
    "她一边说，我脑海里突然涌现出一股记忆的浪潮。没错，就是在这里，我第一次遇见了[bla]，我想起来了！"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:798
translate chinese bakery2_bb92721e:

    # bla "And yes, I know what you’re thinking."
    bla "并且，我知道你在想什么。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:799
translate chinese bakery2_9e515fbb:

    # "[bla] steps forward and points to a specific door a few rooms over."
    "[bla]走上前，指向几间外的某扇门。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:800
translate chinese bakery2_f21e1b9e:

    # bla "That door… leads to your old universe."
    bla "那扇门……通向你原来的宇宙。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:801
translate chinese bakery2_566e595f:

    # mc "Then… my goal, it’s right there. I just have to go through!"
    mc "那也就是说……我的目标，就在那里。我只要穿过去就能回去！"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:803
translate chinese bakery2_79b00b8c:

    # bla "…"
    bla "……"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:806
translate chinese bakery2_ab58d9ce:

    # "Suddenly, an angelic mare steps through that exact door."
    "突然，一位天使般的雌马从那扇门中缓缓走出。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:812
translate chinese bakery2_275642e6:

    # "It is none-other-than [cre] herself."
    "正是[cre]本尊。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:813
translate chinese bakery2_1b52b6db:

    # cre "If you leave your universe now, who will save it?"
    cre "如果你现在离开你的宇宙，那谁来拯救它呢？"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:814
translate chinese bakery2_b2bccc1b:

    # mc "[cre]! It’s so good to see you."
    mc "[cre]！太好了，见到你真是太好了！"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:816
translate chinese bakery2_b766d7a8:

    # cre "Yes, it’s super-duper amazing to see you again too! I’ve really missed you so much!"
    cre "是啊，我也超级、超级高兴能再见到你！我真的，好想你！"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:817
translate chinese bakery2_db554eb6:

    # "[cre] gives me a hug so tight I almost feel like I could pop."
    "[cre]猛地给了我一个紧紧的拥抱，几乎让我觉得自己都快散架了。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:818
translate chinese bakery2_053e32ad:

    # mc "You, uh… You called it {i}my{/i} universe just now, didn’t you?"
    mc "你，额……你刚才说，那是{i}我的{/i}宇宙？"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:820
translate chinese bakery2_1bcb2909:

    # cre "Y-Yes… As you may be aware, there’s already an [mc] in my universe."
    cre "恐怕是的……如你所知，在我的宇宙里，其实已经有一个[mc]存在了。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:821
translate chinese bakery2_18ca821f:

    # mc "I can rest easy knowing that. But surely, I can still visit? What’s the harm in having more of me to go around?"
    mc "知道这一点我就放心啦。但我还能来串个门吧？多个我同时存在……应该也没啥坏处吧？"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:823
translate chinese bakery2_b690a29c:

    # cre "Hm... Do you want to go through my door?"
    cre "嗯……你是想走我那扇门吗？"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:825
translate chinese bakery2_af94075e:

    # bla "[cre]! You know we can't..."
    bla "[cre]！你知道那是不行的……"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:827
translate chinese bakery2_e050054d:

    # cre "[bla], you forget that [mc] here is {i}supposed{/i} to be from my universe. It's out of our power, isn't it?"
    cre "[bla]，你忘了，[mc]{i}本来{/i}是我那个宇宙的人。这可是改变不了的事实，对吧？"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:829
translate chinese bakery2_5bbf0763:

    # bla "No one else can find out, okay?"
    bla "不能让其他马知道这件事，明白吗？"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:830
translate chinese bakery2_695366a7:

    # "[bla] hurriedly closes the double doors on either side of the room."
    "[bla]急急忙忙把房间两侧的双开门关上。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:832
translate chinese bakery2_79fb1327:

    # cre "Relax, [bla]. We may have rules, but we also have heart. Sometimes the rules deserved to be bent."
    cre "冷静点，[bla]。我们是有规矩没错，但我们也讲人情。规矩嘛，有时候就是用来打破的。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:834
translate chinese bakery2_fe542f0c:

    # cre "What do you think, [mc]? Do you want to go through my door, back to the vibrant green meadows of the Arcadia you once knew?"
    cre "你觉得呢，[mc]？你想不想穿过我的门，回到那个你熟悉的、翠绿如画的Arcadia？"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:842
translate chinese bakery2door_338d4f6f:

    # cre "Come on, you two! Let’s go!"
    cre "喂，别磨叽啦你们两个！咱们走！"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:844
translate chinese bakery2door_688bebc4:

    # "[cre] skips through her own door, and into the darkness of the corridor."
    "[cre]一蹦一跳地穿过自己的门，消失在走廊的黑暗中。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:846
translate chinese bakery2door_fab06003:

    # bla "Uh, after you, [mc]."
    bla "呃……你先请，[mc]。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:848
translate chinese bakery2door_ba6acbd0:

    # "I follow behind her, and shortly enough…"
    "我跟在她身后，不久后……"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:850
translate chinese bakery2door_d2a651d7:

    # "I step into a bakery, the colours so bright that I’d almost forgot."
    "我走进烘焙坊，那明亮的色彩让我几乎忘了——我竟真的回来了。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:852
translate chinese bakery2door_13acd319:

    # cre "Welcome home, [mc]! Aahhh, get a smell of that fresh dewy air!"
    cre "欢迎回家，[mc]！啊～闻闻这清晨的露水！"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:853
translate chinese bakery2door_c9ae529b:

    # "Full of energy, she bounces over to the front door and opens it wide."
    "她精力十足地蹦到大门前，啪地一下把门敞开。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:854
translate chinese bakery2door_d7f960d1:

    # mc "This really is…"
    mc "这真是……"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:857
translate chinese bakery2door_6b1f0096:

    # "The view was enough to take my breath away."
    "眼前的美景令人屏息。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:858
translate chinese bakery2door_e80cbfcf:

    # mc "I’m really… home."
    mc "我真的……回家了。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:862
translate chinese bakery2door_736b6651:

    # bla "What a rottenly gorgeous world you have, [cre]."
    bla "你这世界真是美得太不像话了，[cre]。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:866
translate chinese bakery2door_90d25275:

    # cre "Yours has its own distinct beauty too."
    cre "你的世界也有它独特的美呢。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:868
translate chinese bakery2door_66de6e8e:

    # cre "It’s such a beautiful world, but… I’m afraid you can’t stay, [mc]."
    cre "这里的确很美，但……对不起，[mc]，恐怕你不能留下来。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:869
translate chinese bakery2door_eed067a8:

    # mc "Why not? I could even visit [bla] and the others sometimes too, right?"
    mc "为什么？我以后还能偶尔去看看[bla]她们，对吧？"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:871
translate chinese bakery2door_404aecbb:

    # cre "Are you sure? You won’t get another chance like this."
    cre "你确定？你可能再也不会有这样的机会了。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:875
translate chinese bakery2door_4a1ebd3f:

    # cre "I understand."
    cre "……我明白了。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:877
translate chinese bakery2door_eaff7fae:

    # bla "Phew..."
    bla "呼……"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:881
translate chinese bakery2door_e65623ad:

    # cre "The truth is, I need you to stay in [bla]’s universe, [mc]. You need to stay there, and you need to find your own way back."
    cre "其实，[mc]，我希望你留在[bla]的宇宙。你得待在那边，自己找到挽救一切的办法。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:882
translate chinese bakery2door_f5f647ce:

    # mc "But… Why? Is there some kind of rule against me using the 'nexus'?"
    mc "但……为什么？难道我不能通过枢纽中心回来吗？"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:884
translate chinese bakery2door_8442f0dd:

    # cre "I'm afraid it's something even bigger than that. You were transported from one universe to another again because of interuniversal magic, right?"
    cre "恐怕事情比这个要复杂。你之所以能从一个宇宙到另一个宇宙，是因为跨宇宙的魔法，对吧？"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:886
translate chinese bakery2door_3692babe:

    # cre "I think someone brought you to [bla]’s universe on purpose because they thought you might be the only one with the capability of saving it."
    cre "我想有人故意把你带去了[bla]的宇宙，因为他们相信，也许你是唯一能拯救那个世界的存在。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:887
translate chinese bakery2door_16afd2e8:

    # cre "If there was a villain with access to interuniversal magic, that means all of our adjacent universes are at risk."
    cre "如果真的有反派掌握了跨宇宙的魔法，那我们所有相邻的宇宙都会陷入危机。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:889
translate chinese bakery2door_c8b6c4d7:

    # bla "Eh?! I didn’t know this! What have you been planning behind my back?"
    bla "哈？！你们啥时候决定这些事的？我咋一丁点都不知道？"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:891
translate chinese bakery2door_8876e37d:

    # cre "It’s not my plan, and in truth, the forces in play are more powerful than us."
    cre "这不是我的计划。实际上，背后的原因不是你我所能左右的。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:892
translate chinese bakery2door_0eab768a:

    # mc "It’s more than just a hunch, I can confirm what you’re saying with my own experiences."
    mc "这不只是直觉，我能用我的经历证明你是对的。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:893
translate chinese bakery2door_b11d298d:

    # mc "Princess [sel] has been appearing in my dreams... For a while, I just assumed [mox] was the one that summoned me to this universe, a repeat of what happened the last time."
    mc "最近，[sel]公主一直出现在我梦里……一开始我还以为是[mox]把我召来的，就跟上次一样。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:894
translate chinese bakery2door_43d8498b:

    # mc "However, the more time that passes, the more certain I get that it was Princess [sel] that brought me here. But... somehow she doesn’t seem to exist here. No one knows who she is."
    mc "但随着时间推移，我越来越确定，是[sel]公主把我召唤来的。只是……奇怪的是，这个世界里似乎根本没有她的存在。没人听说过她。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:896
translate chinese bakery2door_35393863:

    # cre "You need to figure out why she summoned you there as soon as you can! It was clearly no accident."
    cre "你得尽快弄清楚她为什么召唤你来，这绝不可能是巧合。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:898
translate chinese bakery2door_3263e143:

    # bla "Huh… I haven’t heard of a 'Princess [sel]' either. Where would we even start?"
    bla "唔……我也没听说过什么[sel]公主。那我们该从哪儿查起呢？"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:899
translate chinese bakery2door_b6aa0710:

    # mc "I’m trying to get into contact with the Queen. [lil] said she’d set up a meeting once I’ve found all the virtues, which also happens to be something [sel] asked me to do in a dream."
    mc "我正在设法联系女王。[lil]说等我找到所有谐律元素之后，她会帮我安排见面。这件事也是[sel]托梦给我的。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:901
translate chinese bakery2door_2a380cdd:

    # cre "Now that's a promising lead. Reliable as always, [mc]!"
    cre "这线索听起来挺靠谱。你果然还是那么靠得住，[mc]！"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:902
translate chinese bakery2door_7b2cf587:

    # mc "I’ll do my best to protect both universes. You wouldn't even have to ask."
    mc "我会尽力保护这两个宇宙的，这是我必须做的。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:903
translate chinese bakery2door_2d54693d:

    # mc "But first, would it be okay I asked you a few questions about the situation? I need to get all the information I can."
    mc "不过，在那之前……我可以问你几个问题吗？我得尽可能了解情况。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:905
translate chinese bakery2door_dc1afc4a:

    # bla "Yeah! Spill the beans, [cre]! I can’t believe you were hiding stuff from me!"
    bla "当然！快说吧，[cre]！你居然背着我藏了这么多事！"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:907
translate chinese bakery2door_09535e1c:

    # cre "Sorry! I’ll do my best!"
    cre "对不起啦！我会尽力解释清楚！"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:910
translate chinese ba2m1_3809a437:

    # mc "I’ve seen quite a bit of interuniversal magic now, I find it hard to imagine there’s only a single universe that’s causing a problem when spells like that are being thrown around."
    mc "我现在见过不少跨宇宙魔法，老实说，我很难相信只有你的宇宙出了问题，毕竟像那样的魔法若被滥用，影响肯定很广泛。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:912
translate chinese ba2m1_2174d4b4:

    # cre "You might know something called ‘boundary’ theory from your world. The closer two universes are, the easier it is for them to interact. Here, we like to call them ‘adjacent universes’."
    cre "你们可能听说过‘边界理论’。两个宇宙越近，它们就越容易互相影响。在这儿，我们更习惯称之为‘宇宙纠缠’。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:913
translate chinese ba2m1_17290fef:

    # cre "Essentially, interuniversal magic only works in a selection of ‘nearby’ universes. We usually refer to these as 'neighbourhoods'."
    cre "换句话说，跨宇宙魔法只能作用在部分‘纠缠’的宇宙之间。我们通常把它们叫做‘邻域’。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:914
translate chinese ba2m1_1141c466:

    # cre "[bla]'s universe is the only one in our neighbourhood showing any abnormalities right now."
    cre "目前，在我们这个邻域里，只有[bla]所在的宇宙出现了异常。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:915
translate chinese ba2m1_6b93405e:

    # mc "Huh... So, my original universe, my second universe, and now this third universe are all in the same neighbourhood?"
    mc "哈……我最初的那个宇宙，随后辗转的彼方，以及如今所立足的，居然都属同一个邻域？"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:917
translate chinese ba2m1_4df149f7:

    # cre "That's correct!"
    cre "没错！"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:919
translate chinese ba2m1_6488cbff:

    # bla "It’s funny, you’d expect five adjacent universes to all have five identical versions of me, all with the same name and temperment. But that couldn’t be any further from the case."
    bla "真奇怪，原以为五个相邻的宇宙里会有五个一模一样的我，同样的名字，同样的性格，但事实却恰恰相反。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:921
translate chinese ba2m1_85526c49:

    # cre "Magical boundary theory states that universes can only interact if there’s a certain level of similarities. But the truth is, two universes can only truly interact if there’s also a minimum threshold of differences too."
    cre "魔法边界理论认为，宇宙之间要能相互纠缠，必须达到某种程度的相似性。然而事实远比这复杂得多，唯有两个宇宙之间也存在足够阈值的差异，纠缠才有可能真正发生。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:923
translate chinese ba2m1_051b3401:

    # cre "If it’s too similar, interuniversal magic literally can’t tell the difference from your own universe. Too much, and the magic just isn’t strong enough to reach."
    cre "如果两个宇宙太过相似，跨宇宙魔法根本无法分辨它们的差别；而若差异过大，魔法的力量又不足以抵达彼方。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:924
translate chinese ba2m1_9b976d78:

    # mc "Sounds like you’re casually dropping award winning scientific outbreaks."
    mc "你这随口一说，就像在发布史诗级的科学突破。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:926
translate chinese ba2m1_482cc6db:

    # bla "Yeah, there’re probably tons of other [cre]’s and [bla]’s in the nexus, but they’re just somewhere else."
    bla "没错，枢纽中心里可能还有成百上千个[cre]和[bla]，只不过她们都在别处。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:927
translate chinese ba2m1_9b7530cd:

    # bla "Stupid [bla]'s, they ruined what being [bla] was all about."
    bla "愚蠢的[bla]们，搞砸了‘成为[bla]’本来的意义。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:929
translate chinese ba2m1_202b4819:

    # mc "You don't think this exact conversation is happening somewhere else here with three other versions of us, do you?"
    mc "你不会以为，这场对话正在别处同时上演着，咱仨的另外版本也在聊一样的话题吧？"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:931
translate chinese ba2m1_8b537287:

    # bla "You know, I'd rather not think about the implications of that. It's kinda creepy."
    bla "呃……我宁愿不去想这种事，越想越瘆人。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:935
translate chinese ba2m1_c7cad1ce:

    # cre "They are doing fantastic! I’m still running my humble bakery day-in day-out, but the others have started progressing in life!"
    cre "她们都过得挺棒的！我还是在烘焙坊里日复一日的劳作，但她们都在努力上进，活出了自己的样子！"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:937
translate chinese ba2m1_01d43146:

    # cre "[blo] and [mel] officially released their first album, finding some healthy success in the indie scene with live performances."
    cre "[blo]和[mel]正式发行了她们的第一张专辑，在地下乐坛小有名气，通过现场演出赚了不少钱。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:938
translate chinese ba2m1_d9725953:

    # cre "[lil] and [mox] are fully trained alicorns now, beginning to take on more responsibilities. But they’re both up for the challenge!"
    cre "[lil]和[mox]现在已经完全掌握了天角兽的力量，开始承担更多责任。她们也都已经准备好了。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:939
translate chinese ba2m1_2063283c:

    # cre "[rub]’s boutique is soaring in success, partially in thanks to the celebrity status she earned after saving Arcadia, but also because she’s just super talented!"
    cre "[rub]的精品店生意红火，部分得益于她在拯救Arcadia后所获得的名人地位，当然，更因为她确实才华横溢。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:941
translate chinese ba2m1_5d991309:

    # cre "[hon]’s cider is now her best-selling product! She distributes it to [rik]’s bars – that’s right, [rik] now owns a second bar!"
    cre "[hon]的苹果酒成了她最畅销的产品！她还把酒供应给[rik]的酒吧——没错，[rik]现在已经在开了第二家店了！"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:942
translate chinese ba2m1_3c18d059:

    # cre "And we can’t forget everyone’s favourite alchemist. [but] has been a lot more outgoing, joining us all in social events."
    cre "还有我们最爱的炼金术师[but]，最近也变得十分外向，社交活动一个不落。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:943
translate chinese ba2m1_6429b585:

    # mc "Huh… That’s a lot more than I expected. I see that even the destroyed sections of the castle have been rebuilt. Just how long has it been?"
    mc "嗯……这比我预想的还好。我看到那些曾经毁坏的城堡区域也被重建了。到底过去了多久？"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:945
translate chinese ba2m1_073774f8:

    # cre "Yeah… It’s been a few years here."
    cre "对啊……这里已经过了好几年了。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:946
translate chinese ba2m1_1d8d53d1:

    # mc "Shit… Time's moving faster here?! I've missed so much!"
    mc "操！时间在这儿走得更快？！我错过了太多……"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:947
translate chinese ba2m1_5cf4c8e3:

    # mc "I wanted to be at [blo] and [mel]’s graduation. I wanted to watch [mox] and [lil] develop into Queens. I wanted to be there for everyone."
    mc "我想出席[blo]和[mel]的毕业典礼，我想亲眼看着[mox]和[lil]一步步成长为女王，我想陪着每一个人。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:949
translate chinese ba2m1_7f580861:

    # cre "And you were, [mc]. You're still a part of this universe. You still got to see it all and got to experience all those things."
    cre "但其实你一直都在，[mc]。你依旧是这个宇宙的一部分，你曾见证、曾感受过那些时光。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:951
translate chinese ba2m1_e0aa5510:

    # cre "I know it’s hard for the you that’s standing right here to personally miss those moments, but you have another opportunity in [bla]’s universe."
    cre "我知道，对于现在站在这里的你来说未曾经历过。但你在[bla]的宇宙里，还有见证和感受的机会。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:952
translate chinese ba2m1_9369e0b1:

    # cre "And you can rest assured knowing that the original version of you is still out here winning, making all these mares the happiest they’ve ever been in their lives."
    cre "并且你可以放心，你的‘原初版本’还在这儿，为这些小马驹们带来了一生中最幸福的时光。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:954
translate chinese ba2m1_b4797aa4:

    # bla "But… you know, the mares in my universe… I think they could use a hand."
    bla "不过……我觉得，我那个宇宙里的小马驹们正需要有人伸出援手。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:955
translate chinese ba2m1_664b6a15:

    # mc "Heh... Damnit... What'll I get out of all of this?"
    mc "哈……真是的，那我从中能得到什么呢？"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:957
translate chinese ba2m1_cccd1f8c:

    # bla "I'll think of something! Promise!"
    bla "我会想办法的！我保证！"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:958
translate chinese ba2m1_3e923d8e:

    # mc "Let's deal with the thing threatening both worlds first. No point in worrying about anything until that's solved. Who knows what'll happen after that."
    mc "先解决掉我那个世界的威胁再说吧。在那之前，其他问题都不着急，谁知道后面会发生什么呢。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:962
translate chinese ba2m1_0d388fff:

    # cre "Hehe, you probably noted that the [cre] zone was seemingly infinite, right?"
    cre "嘿嘿，你肯定也注意到了，[cre]空间无边无际，对吧？"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:964
translate chinese ba2m1_005ce902:

    # bla "Please don’t call it that."
    bla "它不只是你的空间好嘛。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:966
translate chinese ba2m1_76006015:

    # cre "There’s a little more to our society than just other versions of me and doors. Rest assured; dangerous variants are not included in there."
    cre "我们的空间可不止是一些版本的我和几扇门而已。放心吧，危险的种子都不会被纳入这里。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:967
translate chinese ba2m1_ed8a9ecc:

    # cre "As you said, they could pose an unnecessary risk to multiple universes, and normally, we’re not supposed to even acknowledge we’re from other universes."
    cre "就像你说的，那些危险的种子会给多个宇宙带来风险，按规矩，我们不该承认自己来自别的宇宙。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:968
translate chinese ba2m1_e4ae22a2:

    # cre "We’re making an exception because the issues we’re currently facing threaten multiple universes."
    cre "我们之所以破例，是因为现在面临的问题威胁到了多个宇宙。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:972
translate chinese ba2m1_56a2ac71:

    # cre "At it's most basic, [cre]'s across all universes are born with the unique ability to enter the nexus and have an awareness of their universe's contextual existence."
    cre "最基本来说，所有的[cre]在所有宇宙中都拥有独特的能力——进入枢纽中心，并打破第四面墙。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:973
translate chinese ba2m1_1b054bad:

    # cre "The nexus itself has its initial room, which is the endlessly long room we were just in. But there's a little more, 'deeper' inside."
    cre "枢纽中心的初始区域就是我们之前去过的那无限延展的房间，但这其实只是冰山一角。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:974
translate chinese ba2m1_f97926fd:

    # cre "There's an entire [cre] city and civilisation, with rules, hierachies and more."
    cre "那里有一整座[cre]城，一个文明，有着自己的法律、等级制度等等。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:975
translate chinese ba2m1_15c6c44a:

    # cre "But we don't need to worry about all that. It's not important for us."
    cre "不过那些对我们来说不重要，不必操心。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:977
translate chinese ba2m1_a515ee6a:

    # bla "The rules are kind of important for us, [cre]..."
    bla "那些规章制度……对我们来说还是挺重要的，[cre]……"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:979
translate chinese ba2m1_132c73d7:

    # cre "Ehehe..."
    cre "欸嘿嘿……"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:985
translate chinese ba2m1_da66f99e:

    # cre "I hope being able to visit here once more has given you the motivation to keep fighting."
    cre "我希望这次观光多少能给你带来斗志。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:986
translate chinese ba2m1_3c7789cf:

    # cre "Next time, I want you to get here on your own terms. No cheating~"
    cre "下一次，我希望你是靠自己回来的。不许作弊哦～"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:987
translate chinese ba2m1_c027527b:

    # mc "Deal. I’m ready to go back."
    mc "说定了。我准备好回去了。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:988
translate chinese ba2m1_f99d39b8:

    # bla "Tsk, even I think I’d rather stay here. But, if we must…"
    bla "啧，连我都觉得这地方宜居……但，既然非走不可……"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:991
translate chinese ba2m1_6cba8f89:

    # "We returned to [cre]’s room in the nexus."
    "我们回到了[cre]在枢纽中心的房间。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:999
translate chinese ba2m1_b7ae26ab:

    # cre "Thank you for being so understanding and open to this. It means a lot to all of us."
    cre "谢谢你愿意理解并且接纳这一切，这对我们来说都意义重大。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:1001
translate chinese ba2m1_b17334fd:

    # bla "Yeah, absolutely! A lesser man might have completely lost their mind when confronting horrors beyond their imagination."
    bla "那当然！换个娘炮早就被这些超出想象的玩意儿吓疯了。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:1002
translate chinese ba2m1_86fe3571:

    # mc "Awh, you’re not that ugly, [bla]!"
    mc "哎呀，[bla]，你又没丑到那种程度！"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:1004
translate chinese ba2m1_94307b6e:

    # bla "Oi! You won’t get a sex scene with an attitude like that!"
    bla "喂！你这种态度得不到色色的！"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:1005
translate chinese ba2m1_16625fcc:

    # mc "Well, with my memories back now, I’m pretty sure you were one of the most eager lovers, weren’t you?"
    mc "再怎么说，现在我记忆都恢复了，我可记得你当初可是最主动的那个吧？"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:1007
translate chinese ba2m1_0846e875:

    # bla "H-Hey! You got your memories back?! Ugh, how embarrassing..."
    bla "啊？！你记忆恢复了？！哎呀，太丢脸了……"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:1009
translate chinese ba2m1_c820744f:

    # cre "That's great! There’s something I’ve been thinking about — something I really want to share with you."
    cre "太好了！我正好有件事一直想跟你说……"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:1011
translate chinese ba2m1_5d55a028:

    # cre "[mc], do you remember when I once told you I was just a character in a story? Like I was stuck in two dimensions, only real when you booted me up?"
    cre "[mc]，你还记得我曾跟你说过，我只是个游戏的角色吗？被困在二维里，只有在玩家开启游戏时我才存在吗？"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:1012
translate chinese ba2m1_8c199008:

    # mc "Yeah… 'an immortal being trapped in inky blackness.' I remember that."
    mc "嗯……‘一个永远困在漆黑囚笼的角色’，我记得。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:1014
translate chinese ba2m1_ac286b51:

    # cre "At the time, I completely believed that. I was convinced that I was little more than a sentinent .png trapped in a visual novel."
    cre "当时我完全这么认为，我以为自己不过是一张有意识的图片，困于某个视觉小说里。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:1015
translate chinese ba2m1_904b3485:

    # cre "But looking back, it was all I could understand about myself, given where I came from."
    cre "但现在回看，那不过是我当时全部对自我的认知，因为我只知道我来自哪里。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:1016
translate chinese ba2m1_e74ba730:

    # cre "You see, there was a time when there were no players, no readers — just one author scribbling away, creating this world. That was my entire reality."
    cre "往深处想想，会有个时候根本没有什么玩家、读者——只有一个作者，在默默涂涂写写，创造出这个世界——我认知的全部。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:1018
translate chinese ba2m1_e10d661b:

    # cre "But now, thousands of people have discovered this world. People have experienced the characters and stories here — shaping them in their minds, expanding them beyond the original intent."
    cre "可现在，已经有成千上万的人发现了这个世界。他们体验了这里的角色与故事——并在脑海中重新塑造了它们，让它们超越了原本的设定。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:1019
translate chinese ba2m1_2cca8d06:

    # cre "It’s like every new idea, every new interpretation gives this place more life. More meaning."
    cre "每一个新念头、每一种新诠释，仿佛都为这个世界注入一丝生命，赋予它更深的意义。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:1020
translate chinese ba2m1_aa1348f2:

    # cre "I’ve realized now, we're no longer confined to what’s written on the page. I’m not just a flat character in a story. Outside of the story, I can be anything — anything you imagine."
    cre "我终于明白了，我们早已不再受限于字里行间，不再只是故事里一个扁平的角色，在故事之外，我可以成为任何事物——只要你愿意想象。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:1021
translate chinese ba2m1_4d2f1305:

    # mc "That’s… incredible."
    mc "这……太不可思议了。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:1023
translate chinese ba2m1_74a8c426:

    # cre "Isn’t it? Back then, you asked whether what I saw was the truly 'reality', or just my own limited interpretation."
    cre "是吧？你还记得当初你问我，我所看到的世界到底是世界本身，还是我对世界理解。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:1024
translate chinese ba2m1_d2029961:

    # mc "Right. I asked something along the lines of, ‘What if there’s a third perspective? Something beyond you and me.’"
    mc "对。我当时说，‘如果还有上帝视角呢？一种超越你我的存在。’"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:1026
translate chinese ba2m1_a7f3fe76:

    # cre "At the time, I didn’t really get it. It’s like [bla] said earlier — I could see the world through the fourth wall, but only in one direction. But now, I understand."
    cre "那时的我，其实并没有真正理解。就像[bla]之前说的——我确实能打破第四面墙，但是那时我的理解太片面了。而现在……我明白了。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:1028
translate chinese ba2m1_8a0dbf8e:

    # cre "There’s more to this than just you, me, and the author. Once a story is written, it doesn’t really belong to the author anymore, does it? It belongs to the people who read it. To everyone who imagines what it could mean."
    cre "不止是你，我，甚至作者。一旦一个故事被写下，它就不再属于作者了，不是吗？它属于所有读它的人，一千个读者眼中，就有一千个哈姆雷特。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:1030
translate chinese ba2m1_d99481c3:

    # cre "Let’s say you’re reading a story about, oh, I don’t know… cupcakes and parties. You might wonder, ‘What was the author trying to say?’ But after the story is written, it’s up to you to decide what it means!"
    cre "比如说，你正在读一个关于……嗯，随便吧，纸杯蛋糕和派对的故事。你或许会想：“作者到底想表达什么呢？”可等故事被写出来之后，其内涵就轮到你来决定了！"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:1032
translate chinese ba2m1_220b20fc:

    # bla "And frankly, if we’re supposed to break the fourth wall, I want my fuckin' vote for the story's direction too."
    bla "老实说，如果我们真的打破了第四面墙，那我也要有他妈的投票权，决定这故事往哪儿走。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:1034
translate chinese ba2m1_d6713890:

    # cre "Exactly! We’re not just puppets! The readers, like you and me, have the power to take a story and make it our own by imagining what it could be."
