# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:1313
translate chinese ba2m1_bb5880ef:

    # bla "I guess you know how I got this place up and running so fast now."
    bla "我猜你现在应该明白，我是怎么这么快就把这地方运转起来的了吧。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:1314
translate chinese ba2m1_eeb6ea8b:

    # mc "It’d be nice if they could help out in other areas, but I appreciate having an army of identical mares running around would probably be a bad idea."
    mc "如果她们也能帮上其他方面的忙，那当然最好……不过想想满大街跑着一堆长得一模一样的小马，恐怕也不是什么好主意。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:1316
translate chinese ba2m1_ffcbde51:

    # bla "Ah, we don’t need them! We’ve got this, and by ‘we,’ I mean you’ve got this, because I have no idea where the other virtues are."
    bla "哎呀，我们不需要她们啦！我们自己就能搞定——准确点说，是你能搞定，因为我根本不知道其他几位谐律都在哪儿呢。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:1318
translate chinese ba2m1_dafe196f:

    # bla "A lot of this is on your shoulders, best I can do for now is massage them when they get weary."
    bla "现在一切都压在你肩上了，我目前唯一能做的大概就是等你累了帮你揉揉肩。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:1319
translate chinese ba2m1_ee0223bb:

    # mc "Sometimes that’s all I need to keep going. Just sit tight, and I’ll let you know when we’re ready to visit the Queen."
    mc "这已经足够让我继续坚持下去了。你先在这休息，我准备好去见女王的时候会叫你。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:1321
translate chinese ba2m1_4728eb63:

    # bla "Fantastic! I’ll get the massage oil and look forward to hearing from you and [lil]. Consider me part of the team!"
    bla "不错！我这就去拿按摩油，然后等你和[lil]的消息，把我当成队员之一吧！"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:1323
translate chinese ba2m1_d39b867f:

    # "We had one last hug before we parted ways, and I returned to the apartment."
    "我们最后抱了一下，便各自离开，我回到了公寓。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:1325
translate chinese ba2m1_1e44564a:

    # "Here, I found [mox] reading a book in bed, but she didn’t need any encouragement to put it down and direct all her attention towards me."
    "[mox]正靠在床上看书，在看到我回来后，立马就把书放下，全神贯注地看着我。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:1328
translate chinese ba2m1_1109ef8e:

    # mox "Welcome back! You weren't gone for long at all today."
    mox "欢迎回家！今天你没去很久呀。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:1329
translate chinese ba2m1_d9aec9c6:

    # "I check my phone and she's right. It's like I walked to the bakery and straight back."
    "我低头看了眼手机，她说得没错，就好像我只是走到烘焙坊，又原路走回来一样。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:1331
translate chinese ba2m1_d9f57c22:

    # mox "Well, perfect timing anyway! I wanted to ask you about something."
    mox "不过刚刚好！我正好想问你点事呢。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:1332
translate chinese ba2m1_19dff0ca:

    # mc "Sure, what's on your mind, [mox]?"
    mc "当然，咋了，[mox]？"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:1334
translate chinese ba2m1_46e845c5:

    # mox "I was just reading this book, and the protagonist has a twin sister. They were basically in tune with all their opinions and actions."
    mox "我刚才在看这本书，里面的主角有个双胞胎姐姐。她们小时候几乎什么想法和反应都一样，完全同步。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:1335
translate chinese ba2m1_8df9ac16:

    # mox "But then, they went to different colleges and drifted apart completely. By the time they met up again, they couldn’t connect in the same ways. The distance between them was too different, even though they were still identical."
    mox "但后来，她们去了不同的大学，逐渐变得陌生，再见面时，就无法像以前那样心有灵犀了。她们之间的隔阂变得太大了……虽然外表还是一模一样。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:1337
translate chinese ba2m1_60178433:

    # mox "Maybe it sounds a little silly, but I was wondering what the other version of me was like."
    mox "可能听起来有点傻，但我就在想，另一个版本的我，会是怎样的人呢？"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:1338
translate chinese ba2m1_299fff02:

    # mc "Not a silly question at all, but unfortunately the answer isn’t that interesting."
    mc "这问题一点也不傻呀，不过可惜的是答案可能有些无聊。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:1339
translate chinese ba2m1_5c0482b4:

    # mc "Both versions of you are identical in every way. If I gave you quizzes with questions for your favourite food, colour and more, you’d come back with the same answers."
    mc "两个版本的你，在各方面都是一模一样的。如果我给你们俩分别出一份问卷，问你最喜欢的食物、颜色之类的，你们给出的答案也都会一模一样。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:1341
translate chinese ba2m1_cd3b170b:

    # mox "Seriously? I wonder what it'd be like to have a conversation with her. Has there been anyone you’ve met so far that’s been extremely different between universes?"
    mox "真的假的？我真想知道，跟她聊聊天会是什么感觉。你在这些宇宙之间穿来穿去，有没有遇到过那种差异特别大的版本？"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:1342
translate chinese ba2m1_bb99edbd:

    # mc "Funny that you say that, because [bla] and [cre] from the bakeries are such different people that they have unique names and fur colours."
    mc "你这么一说倒挺有趣的，因为烘焙坊里的[bla]和[cre]之间就差得特别大，她们甚至连名字、毛色都完全不一样。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:1343
translate chinese ba2m1_15406a0b:

    # mc "I feel like they’d have genuinely opposite answers if I gave them the same quiz."
    mc "我觉得，要是给她们做同一份问卷，答案说不定会完全相反。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:1345
translate chinese ba2m1_60b4411e:

    # mox "Ahaha, I guess it’s nice that some aspects of this world are keeping you on your toes."
    mox "哈哈哈，也挺好，总得有点未知感才不会让你太松懈。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:1346
translate chinese ba2m1_ef90d0b1:

    # mc "But it is nice to have something familiar and comforting to return to every night."
    mc "不过……每天晚上能回到这个熟悉又舒适的地方真好。"

# game/4.5 - Bakery Route.rpy:1348
translate chinese ba2m1_421e8518:

    # mox "Ooohh, I’ll show you ‘comforting’~! Get your butt under these covers with me."
    mox "哦哟～你想要“舒适”？我来让你舒服舒服～快点钻进被窝来陪我。"

